  m_text: '<b>INVENTORY & PAUSE</b>


    <b>Items:</b> Open Inventory, select an
    item, then tap a character or object to use it. Cancel item clears the selection.


    <b>Case
    notes:</b> Tap collected clues to reread them. Gray clue buttons unlock when
    found.


    <b>Pause:</b> Continue resumes the case. Help opens these instructions.'
